{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_7077D148","title":"Thaddeus strange message 3","entry":"Dlg_7077D148::entry","exit":"Dlg_7077D148::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_F86E6E33","articyId":"72057645577588744","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"I have a message from Thaddeus, but... it says this is his last.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I have a message from Thaddeus, but... it says this is his last.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":550.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"31501","byteOffset":19799000,"byteLength":408}},{"id":"DFr_FE4EEBC2","articyId":"72057645577588764","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Thaddeus Carminus","text":"I'm rattled kid. Buffeted back and forward through time, bouncing off the big bang and smacking against the long darkness, only to come all the way back. Had to send this message via a singularity just past Hades Five.","speakerId":"Ntt_C9C0A9E5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I'm rattled kid. Buffeted back and forward through time, bouncing off the big bang and smacking against the long darkness, only to come all the way back. Had to send this message via a singularity just past Hades Five.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1150.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"24564","byteOffset":17169240,"byteLength":528}},{"id":"DFr_C262ADDB","articyId":"72057645577588778","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"I can't determine the origin of the message, nor its age.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I can't determine the origin of the message, nor its age.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1750.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"35112","byteOffset":25644264,"byteLength":368}},{"id":"DFr_577ACDDC","articyId":"72057645577588785","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Thaddeus Carminus","text":"So this trip... you might wonder why I'm doing it. I mean, we already know that if we go back far enough, we can see what it was like BEFORE me. And AFTER me... well, I now know that my influence fades. But never disappears.","speakerId":"Ntt_C9C0A9E5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"So this trip... you might wonder why I'm doing it. I mean, we already know that if we go back far enough, we can see what it was like BEFORE me. And AFTER me... well, I now know that my influence fades. But never disappears.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2050.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"26818","byteOffset":18025192,"byteLength":568}},{"id":"DFr_44CE82BA","articyId":"72057645577588799","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"Analysis of his vocal patterns indicates significantly less emotional range. He seems... calmer.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Analysis of his vocal patterns indicates significantly less emotional range. He seems... calmer.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2650.0,"y":325.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"48008","byteOffset":32499344,"byteLength":404}},{"id":"DFr_D001DCF4","articyId":"72057645577588806","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Thaddeus Carminus","text":"All of this temporal sling-shotting sure does make your head spin. And your stomach heave. I could go for a bowl of noodles to settle my gut right now. Ask Banor to prepare some for me.","speakerId":"Ntt_C9C0A9E5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"All of this temporal sling-shotting sure does make your head spin. And your stomach heave. I could go for a bowl of noodles to settle my gut right now. Ask Banor to prepare some for me.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2950.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"36119","byteOffset":28011616,"byteLength":496}},{"id":"DFr_97911F30","articyId":"72057645577588813","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"That's the end of the message. Did you pick up on what he said at the end?","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"That's the end of the message. Did you pick up on what he said at the end?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3250.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"17811","byteOffset":14626464,"byteLength":384}},{"id":"DFr_670A9ED9","articyId":"72057645577588827","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"I agree. It's clear he knows more.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I agree. It's clear he knows more.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3850.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"40729","byteOffset":29736000,"byteLength":344}},{"id":"DFr_F43ECDD4","articyId":"72057821671327683","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"Not really. That was who he was. Or is.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Not really. That was who he was. Or is.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2650.0,"y":575.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"44830","byteOffset":31293848,"byteLength":348}},{"id":"DFr_D0D58933","articyId":"72057645577588757","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Play it.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Play it.","TextSheVersion":"Play it.","TextTheyVersion":"Play it."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":850.0,"y":325.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"40942","byteOffset":29816376,"byteLength":288}},{"id":"DFr_41033168","articyId":"72057645577588771","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Is that true?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Is that true?","TextSheVersion":"Is that true?","TextTheyVersion":"Is that true?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1450.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"26359","byteOffset":17854368,"byteLength":296}},{"id":"DFr_C5AAA9A6","articyId":"72057645577588792","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"He sounds strange.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"He sounds strange.","TextSheVersion":"He sounds strange.","TextTheyVersion":"He sounds strange."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":2350.0,"y":325.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"44348","byteOffset":31109312,"byteLength":300}},{"id":"DFr_FD322C5B","articyId":"72057645577588820","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player",